# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SAFETY RULES — do not relax these without reading evidence/README.md
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Screenshots stay out until they have been redacted. Once an image has been
# cropped and checked against the checklist in evidence/README.md, add an
# explicit negation for that one file, e.g.:
#     !evidence/01-project-cost-report.png
evidence/*.png
evidence/*.jpg
evidence/*.jpeg
evidence/*.PNG

# Never commit coursework submissions, curriculum material, or peer reviews.
*.docx
*.doc
*.pptx
*.pdf
*.xlsx
*.xls

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Standard
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
env/
*.sqlite
*.db
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
